# Mobile icons and chrome

- Never use single-letter or abbreviation marks as tab icons, FABs, or action buttons (e.g. "M", "C", "P", "A").
- Use `@expo/vector-icons` (Ionicons) or another real icon set for tabs, FABs, list actions, and screen headers.
- Pair icons with short labels where navigation needs text; icon-only only for secondary FABs with a clear metaphor (e.g. warning triangle for ocorrência).
- Occurrence / report is an optional secondary action (Waze-style FAB), not a primary full-width CTA on the map home.
- Prefer one shared `Icon` helper under `mobile/src/components` instead of ad-hoc letter `Text` icons.
